        "action:n2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "For SSP, the process begins by receiving the invoice."
      ],
      "justification": "Structural init and first action directly correspond to the opening clause."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After receiving the invoice, it is sorted per client."
      ],
      "justification": "Exact paraphrase of the sorting step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once sorted per client, it is then sorted per vendor."
      ],
      "justification": "Exact paraphrase of the second sorting step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "The next step is to attach the invoice entry form to the invoice."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly matches the attachment instruction."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After attaching the form, the required information is entered onto the form."
      ],
      "justification": "Faithfully restates the data entry step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Following that, the completeness of the invoice is checked."
      ],
      "justification": "Action performs the check and implicitly triggers the XOR branch."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the invoice is not complete"
      ],
      "justification": "Guard condition accurately reflects the negative case trigger."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "the process ends."
      ],
      "justification": "Action and structural end node correctly model the termination path."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the priority is high"
      ],
      "justification": "Guard correctly captures the high priority condition."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n11"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "a red stamp is placed on the entry invoice."
      ],
      "justification": "Action precisely matches the stamping instruction."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->c1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If it is low"
      ],
      "justification": "Guard correctly captures the low priority condition leading to continuation."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "The invoice compliance is then checked."
      ],
      "justification": "Action faithfully reproduces the compliance check step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b3->n13"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
